{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tony the Mole is a cozy underground adventure where you play as a curious little mole with dreams of reaching the surface. Raised by humans in the town of Pebblegrove, Tony sets out on a journey to uncover the town\u2019s secrets, help its quirky residents, and dig his way toward the world above.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562370/extras/cc22e769a605afaf0cdf4a8e8f90e29b.poster.avif?t=1755512573\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562370/extras/cc22e769a605afaf0cdf4a8e8f90e29b.webm?t=1755512573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562370/extras/cc22e769a605afaf0cdf4a8e8f90e29b.mp4?t=1755512573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dig through dirt</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>Burrow through soft soil and carve tunnels under barriers to uncover new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562370/extras/850f1303ff839224d8050c2cd63496cb.poster.avif?t=1755512573\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562370/extras/850f1303ff839224d8050c2cd63496cb.webm?t=1755512573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562370/extras/850f1303ff839224d8050c2cd63496cb.mp4?t=1755512573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use your mole sense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sniff out earthworms, hidden passages, and secret treasures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" 